ってるね🐱🩷"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはまだブログで触れられていなかった\n四期生楽曲、「足の小指を箪笥の角にぶつけた」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この曲だーーいすき！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、はるはるセンターおめでとう🥳\n四期生の中で足の小指を箪笥の角にぶつけて\nそうランキング、ぶっちぎりです。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mob8iyO6U.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は理央ちゃんと初めてのシンメ\nたまりおなんだ~~🩷🩵"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌割りも一緒で嬉しい。\nケンカをしてるって振付がとてもお気に入り！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mobONs6mO.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、今回は、2回目の2列目だったんだ！\n嬉しかったな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レターとかミーグリで\n自分のことのように\n一緒にいっぱい喜んでくれてありがと、\nなんかそれが嬉しくてね、\n何回も泣きそうになっちゃった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと頑張るから、いつかね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mobwOzF4P.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mobY1P9ty.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく今は目の前に迫ってきた\nひらがなライブだーー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13枚目シングル期間の集大成、\n絶対にみせるんだから~！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月のリアミではいっぱい感想聞かせてね🥰"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それじゃそろそろおわるね~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！！これ重要事項！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":